      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28959:28961"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“不，马克也不在。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28961:28973"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“哦……”他低头看了看，然后抬头盯着你，就这样过了几秒。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:28973:29003"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我还能为你做什么吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29003:29017"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“他们在哪？”他问。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29017:29029"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你叫什么？我可以转告他们你来过。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29029:29049"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他就只盯着你。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29049:29058"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要让陌生人离开，转到 117。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29058:29075"
    },
    {
      "id": "123:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "*要把门摔在他脸上，转到 128。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:29075:29094"
    }
  ]
}
